@startuml
!include _astyle.iuml
title 5.5  Supplier / Vendor Selection & Reassessment (QP.13) — Activity
|Applicant|
start
:Submit application / recommendation;
|Purchasing|
:Verify identity & capability (F225);
|QAD|
:(Optional) site audit (F225A); evaluate QMS;
|Purchasing|
:Table evaluation to JTP;
|JTP / MD|
:Compare min 3 (cost, capability, capacity,
quality, TAT); rate & select;
if (Approved?) then (no)
  |Purchasing|
  :No further action;
  stop
else (yes)
  |Purchasing|
  :Register in Approved Supplier List (F224);
  :Reassess performance every 3 years (F226);
  if (Not Suitable & 2nd CAR (F516)?) then (yes)
    :Drop from Approved List;
  else (no)
    :Retain on Approved List;
  endif
  stop
endif
@enduml
